{
  "FormatVersion": "1.0",
  "Rules": [
    {
      "RuleName": "邮件系统缓存-mail",
      "Branches": [
        {
          "Condition": "${http.request.host} in ['mail.example.com']",
          "Actions": [
            {
              "Name": "Cache",
              "CacheParameters": {
                "FollowOrigin": {
                  "Switch": "on",
                  "DefaultCache": "off",
                  "DefaultCacheStrategy": "off",
                  "DefaultCacheTime": 0
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "Name": "CacheKey",
              "CacheKeyParameters": {
                "QueryString": {
                  "Switch": "off",
                  "Values": []
                },
                "FullURLCache": "on",
                "IgnoreCase": "on"
              }
            }
          ],
          "SubRules": [
            {
              "Branches": [
                {
                  "Condition": "${http.request.uri.path} matches '^/api/email/content/'",
                  "Actions": [
                    {
                      "Name": "Cache",
                      "CacheParameters": {
                        "CustomTime": {
                          "Switch": "on",
                          "IgnoreCacheControl": "off",
                          "CacheTime": 604800
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Condition": "${http.request.uri.path} matches '^/(static/|attachments/|api/oss/)'",
                  "Actions": [
                    {
                      "Name": "Cache",
                      "CacheParameters": {
                        "CustomTime": {
                          "Switch": "on",
                          "IgnoreCacheControl": "off",
                          "CacheTime": 604800
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Condition": "${http.request.uri.path} matches '^/assets/'",
                  "Actions": [
                    {
                      "Name": "Cache",
                      "CacheParameters": {
                        "CustomTime": {
                          "Switch": "on",
                          "IgnoreCacheControl": "off",
                          "CacheTime": 31556952
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Condition": "${http.request.uri.path} matches '^/(tinymce|image)/'",
                  "Actions": [
                    {
                      "Name": "Cache",
                      "CacheParameters": {
                        "CustomTime": {
                          "Switch": "on",
                          "IgnoreCacheControl": "off",
                          "CacheTime": 604800
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Condition": "${http.request.uri.path} matches '^/(|index.html|sw.js|manifest.webmanifest)$'",
                  "Actions": [
                    {
                      "Name": "Cache",
                      "CacheParameters": {
                        "NoCache": {
                          "Switch": "on"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Condition": "${http.request.uri.path} matches '^/api/'",
                  "Actions": [
                    {
                      "Name": "Cache",
                      "CacheParameters": {
                        "CustomTime": {
                          "Switch": "on",
                          "IgnoreCacheControl": "off",
                          "CacheTime": 0
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "Description": [
                "正文 /api/email/content/ 缓存7天; 附件 static|attachments|api/oss 缓存7天;",
                "hash静态资源 /assets/ 缓存1年; tinymce/image 缓存7天;",
                "入口HTML/SW/manifest 不缓存(发版即生效); 其余 /api/* 动态接口每次回源保实时"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "Description": [
        "邮件系统缓存规则 v2(2026-08-15 复查修订)",
        "【重要】v1 的路径规则 ^/email/content/ 是错的——EdgeOne 在 CDN 层看到的是浏览器原始 URL，",
        "axios baseURL='/api'，真实路径带 /api 前缀(如 /api/email/content/1)，Worker 内部才剥前缀。",
        "v2 全部改为带 /api 的真实路径，并补齐静态资源与入口页规则。",
        "【部署前必做】将 mail.example.com 替换为线上真实访问域名",
        "原理: 正文/附件是不可变内容(内容寻址),边缘长缓存; 动态API每次回源保实时; HTML/SW不缓存防发版白屏",
        "源站配合: Worker 已全局对 API 注入 Cache-Control:no-store + cdn-cache-control:no-store 双头,本规则是CDN层双保险",
        "CacheKey: 忽略 QueryString(正文/附件按路径缓存),全URL缓存,忽略大小写",
        "实测方法: curl -I <域名>/api/email/content/1 -H 'token: <JWT>' 观察响应头 EO-Cache-Status(首次MISS,二次HIT)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
